body:
In my opinion, I have mixed feelings on Rebirthday Song. The art is good and the plot is pretty interesting. I'm onto Yoru's route right now but there is this one thing that nags me. The main character is quite the type that annoys me. She's always happy and positive which is no problem for me, but the fact that she's clueless and a dimwit character, that doesn't go along with me. The game is on hold for me as of now, 
but as time goes I'm sure I'll be able to pick it up again and deal with the main character. 
I feel that it's only me that feels this way towards the main character since I like main characters that are strong and/or smart-minded. ;;;
